# Origin of the ApplyIQ API — no trailing slash, no /api suffix.
# src/lib/api.js appends /api itself, and SocketContext connects to the origin.
#
# The VITE_ prefix is required: Vite only exposes variables beginning with
# VITE_ to browser code via import.meta.env. Anything without that prefix stays
# server-side in the build process and reads as undefined in the app — which is
# also why no secret belongs in this file: every VITE_ value is baked into the
# bundle in plain text and is readable by anyone who loads the site.
#
# Local dev falls back to http://localhost:3000 when this is unset.
VITE_API_URL=
